v 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T14:49:27-07:00","id":1250537,"title":"","content":"I don't feel an art is the answer, Changeling really needs some way to get one off powers like combos.. or rituals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T15:51:16-07:00","id":1250555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250515-idea-art-centered-on-allowing-kithain-access-to-nunehi-style-harvesting-of-glamour?p=1250537#post1250537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't feel an art is the answer, Changeling really needs some way to get one off powers like combos.. or rituals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Rituals would be cool. Also would be useful to cover say pre-changeling fae going through the Changeling Way ritual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T16:10:45-07:00","id":1250561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zenten</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250515-idea-art-centered-on-allowing-kithain-access-to-nunehi-style-harvesting-of-glamour?p=1250555#post1250555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Rituals would be cool. Also would be useful to cover say pre-changeling fae going through the Changeling Way ritual.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There is that, but I mean broadly I think changeling needs the ability to add a power without having to add a whole new art, Vampire gets away with this with combos and rituals, Werewolf.. its easy to add a new gift without having to add 4 other new gifts. Wraith has both combos and alternative levels of power..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T16:24:00-07:00","id":1250563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250515-idea-art-centered-on-allowing-kithain-access-to-nunehi-style-harvesting-of-glamour?p=1250561#post1250561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> There is that, but I mean broadly I think changeling needs the ability to add a power without having to add a whole new art, Vampire gets away with this with combos and rituals, Werewolf.. its easy to add a new gift without having to add 4 other new gifts. Wraith has both combos and alternative levels of power..</div> </div> </div> </div>I think some sort of ritual system would be better than something like a combo discipline or the like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-01T17:08:32-07:00","id":1250573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>zenten</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250515-idea-art-centered-on-allowing-kithain-access-to-nunehi-style-harvesting-of-glamour?p=1250563#post1250563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think some sort of ritual system would be better than something like a combo discipline or the like.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There are advantages to all, I think changeling could use rituals/rites, comboing Arts, and alternative art levels. Yes i know you can unleash arts but what if you want to unleash the same effect regularly like say turning someone to stone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T19:48:27-07:00","id":1250947,"title":"","content":"think some kind of ritual magics better then inventing a new art?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-02T20:12:55-07:00","id":1250950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250515-idea-art-centered-on-allowing-kithain-access-to-nunehi-style-harvesting-of-glamour?p=1250947#post1250947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">think some kind of ritual magics better then inventing a new art?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. A ritual would have specific things to do to make it happen, while almost all Arts don't. It wouldn't have to fit into the Realm system. And you wouldn't have to put it into a 1-5 scale of an Art, plus adding ideas for Unleashing.<br /> <br /> There are already some examples of similar things, like Treasure crafting and Oaths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T11:13:58-07:00","id":1251120,"title":"","content":"I feel as thought rituals do not go along with the typical Dreaming theme.<br /> <br /> If you are talking about limiting ritual use to certain Seemings, such as Grumps, or older Wilder, maybe ... else wise this may fall on the Unseelie, or even the Autumn People, because the Dreaming is supposed to be about imagination manifesting into reality.<br /> <br /> Having a ritual where you need to do prep work, gather specified items and following a guided criteria seems rather Banal. It no longer thrives off of the wide eyed wonderment of the Wylde, making it uniform &amp; mechanical.<br /> <br /> It could make for interesting plot hook, where some brazen obstinate Wilder(s) seek out to prove there's a way to maintain Trod while interjecting something most would consider so mundane.<br /> <br /> It could also serve as a good lessen to younger Chinldling(s) / Wilder(s) as a cautionary tale [subplot] to shown what could happen if you stepped off the Silver Path, with an encounter of those who chose the risks of Chimerical threats and the dangers, suffering Bedlam, by trying to mix the intangible [Glamour] with the substantial [Material].<br /> <br /> Of course, I suppose you could always use the rules to create your own Kith who practice such inculcation. Maybe one that is tightrope walking the Seelie/Unseelie courts ... or maybe a branch of Sidhe.<br /> <br /> Fundamentally, though, I do not believe Rituals fit the Changeling archetype.<br /> <br /> .<br /> .<br /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6040-quiet-storm","name":"Quiet Storm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T12:34:16-07:00","id":1251145,"title":"","content":"Ideas on how to turn the idea into a art?<br /> <br /> just hate the idea of house Ailils speculation being for nothing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T12:47:50-07:00","id":1251146,"title":"","content":"Quiet Storm: you have a very strange view of Banality that does not fit what is written for Changeling, especially not in C20.<br /> <br /> I also don't see how even by your criteria anything but Unleashing would be Banal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T14:58:14-07:00","id":1251192,"title":"","content":"You are talking about using a Humanized Ritualistic approach at crafting your intent. By doing that, you push aside your Fae nature. Ritual work is not something Fae need to accomplish their doings. In esse; you would be embracing your humanity, which is very Banal.<br /> <br /> .<br /> .<br /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6040-quiet-storm","name":"Quiet Storm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6040_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T15:48:40-07:00","id":1251206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Quiet Storm</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1250515-idea-art-centered-on-allowing-kithain-access-to-nunehi-style-harvesting-of-glamour?p=1251192#post1251192\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are talking about using a Humanized Ritualistic approach at crafting your intent. By doing that, you push aside your Fae nature. Ritual work is not something Fae need to accomplish their doings. In esse; you would be embracing your humanity, which is very Banal.<br /> <br /> .<br /> .<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, none of that is close to how I interpret the books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T16:34:24-07:00","id":1251222,"title":"","content":"Quiet Storm, your argument would invalidate OATHS... come to think of it Oaths could be a good &quot;build into rituals setup&quot; perhaps taking some ideas from C:TL For that.<br /> <br /> On the op's question, currently one Kith CAN do what you say the Green Men. They have as one of their Birthrights. Now THERE are powers that simulate birthrights(Poor pooka and Selkie) but that is the EQUIVALENT Of a level 3 art. So it should cost that equivalent in development for those who want to engage with it.<br /> <br /> I am not sure what an art of glamour manipulation would cover. This is why I'm suggesting some sort of one off ability. I'm thinking if Rituals existed something like that but Perhaps an alternative Soverign level that lets you harvest glamour from your territory.. hmmmmmm","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-03T16:52:33-07:00","id":1251229,"title":"","content":"I don't think an Art of glamour manipulation makes sense. Either use an existing Art with Fae 5, or make up a new Art for the specific effect that isn't found in an existing Art.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"zenten","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10243_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"488"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-04T04:46:00-07:00","id":1251341,"title":"","content":"There are afew basic powers Changelings lack that could potentially be rolled into it, Aura reading, the ability to see active supernatural effects but it would be a hard one to build","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":